      "comment": "Menilek: Holawaqa Ngoubou",
      "content": "The text archived for the Golden Tyrant of the Broken Oath calls him a Qucusaur whose body took on a supernatural form from forces modern Saurians cannot control. It says the giant of the mountain fog once followed the heroes who saved Natlan, and that one of them agreed to make the pilgrimage to the volcano with him to pull his mind back from the brink; his present title suggests this did not end well. Flower-Wreathed Feathers ties the story to Menilek.",
